# ☕ Java Practice

Welcome to my **Java Practice** repository! 🚀

This repository contains my Java programming practice, covering basic to advanced concepts along with coding interview questions and problem-solving exercises.

## 📌 Topics Covered

### 🔹 Basics
- Variables & Data Types
- Operators
- Input/Output
- Conditional Statements
- Loops
- Pattern Printing

### 🔹 Arrays
- Array Traversal
- Insert Element
- Delete Element
- Reverse Array
- Find Largest & Smallest
- Second Largest
- Remove Duplicates
- Rotate Array
- Frequency of Elements
- Kadane's Algorithm

### 🔹 Strings
- Reverse String
- Palindrome
- Anagram
- Count Vowels
- Remove Spaces
- Remove Duplicates
- Reverse Words
- Toggle Case
- First Non-Repeating Character
- Longest Common Prefix
- Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters

### 🔹 Searching
- Linear Search
- Binary Search

### 🔹 Sorting
- Bubble Sort
- Selection Sort
- Insertion Sort
- Merge Sort
- Quick Sort

### 🔹 Mathematics
- Prime Number
- GCD & LCM
- Factorial
- Fibonacci
- Armstrong Number
- Palindrome Number
- Power of Number

### 🔹 Recursion
- Basic Problems
- Factorial
- Fibonacci
- Sum of Digits
- Reverse Number

### 🔹 Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
- Classes & Objects
- Constructors
- Inheritance
- Polymorphism
- Abstraction
- Encapsulation
- Interfaces

### 🔹 Collections
- ArrayList
- LinkedList
- Stack
- Queue
- HashMap
- HashSet

### 🔹 Coding Interview Questions
- TCS NQT
